2026-10-23T09:00:12.3917576Z 
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3917681Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3918024Z 
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3918110Z Commands:
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3918503Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3919255Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3920068Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3920909Z   virtual-server      Serve two virtual test devices; this experimental mode provides no authentication or TLS
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3921625Z   devices             Scan local devices without changing drivers. Discovery is not compatibility validation
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3922256Z   doctor              Read installed tool, module and helper capabilities without loading modules
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3923118Z   discover            Query a server's USB/IP device list over an administrator-managed trusted network
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3923842Z   export              Export an administrator-allowlisted device fingerprint via the privileged helper
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3924507Z   unexport            Release an allowlisted export and request local driver reattachment
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3925091Z   attach              Import a remote bus ID through an allowlisted endpoint and Linux VHCI
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3925588Z   detach              Disconnect an authorized local VHCI port (0..255)
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3926114Z   sessions            Read authoritative native kernel session state through the helper
2026-10-23T09:00:12.3926577Z   status              Query helper and kernel status
